  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_citron_cb36af3af7bb513c4f3f4525403d7fbd2263ea1fafc2dd777ce6988528f7f01476">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>an ovate acid juicy tree-fruit with a pale yellow rind. Formerly the name included the lemon, and perhaps the lime, as well as the fruit to which it is now restricted, which is larger, less acid, and has a thicker rind than the lemon (OED citron), here dried</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
